# Keep the build context clean: without this, `COPY . .` overlays the macOS
# node_modules on top of the linux `npm ci` install and ships a stale local dist/.
# NOTE: .env is deliberately NOT ignored — Vite inlines VITE_* vars at build time,
# so the .env present on the machine that builds the image is what ships.
node_modules
dist
.git
Archive.zip
*.zip
